{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/追刃•凛冬极星","pageid":8495,"revid":21064,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%BF%BD%E5%88%83%E2%80%A2%E5%87%9B%E5%86%AC%E6%9E%81%E6%98%9F&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%BF%BD%E5%88%83%E2%80%A2%E5%87%9B%E5%86%AC%E6%9E%81%E6%98%9F&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E8%BF%BD%E5%88%83%E2%80%A2%E5%87%9B%E5%86%AC%E6%9E%81%E6%98%9F&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>追刃•凛冬极星</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E8.BF.BD.E5.88.83.E2.80.A2.E5.87.9B.E5.86.AC.E6.9E.81.E6.98.9F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"追刃•凛冬极星\"><b>追刃•凛冬极星</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" style=\"max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\">\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"5\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"技能 追刃•凛冬极星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/ea/dclp01gjx3p87nmvpop1g71w3kyrssq.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E8%BF%BD%E5%88%83%E2%80%A2%E5%87%9B%E5%86%AC%E6%9E%81%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/ea/dclp01gjx3p87nmvpop1g71w3kyrssq.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E8%BF%BD%E5%88%83%E2%80%A2%E5%87%9B%E5%86%AC%E6%9E%81%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/ea/dclp01gjx3p87nmvpop1g71w3kyrssq.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />追刃•凛冬极星\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>对地面\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-3\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓1-↑1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>正前方半圆4格\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（物理伤害）选择[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">空地</span>]，进行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冲锋\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冲锋</font></span></span>]，随后对自身正前方半圆<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>格内敌人造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">100%</font>范围伤害，每额外命中1名敌人，技能倍率降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>，最低至80%。<br />✦攻击前，对目标施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▼物防2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▼物防2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"×反应技\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">×反应技</font></span></span>]，自身获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲攻击2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲攻击2</font></span></span>]，所有效果持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。<br />✦释放后或行动结束后，技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">追刃</font></span>]还原为初始状态。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-3 正前方半圆4格.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/df/0duw9bvodjw42ggazlgzycrtowr4u53.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-3_%E6%AD%A3%E5%89%8D%E6%96%B9%E5%8D%8A%E5%9C%864%E6%A0%BC.png.jpeg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/df/0duw9bvodjw42ggazlgzycrtowr4u53.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-3_%E6%AD%A3%E5%89%8D%E6%96%B9%E5%8D%8A%E5%9C%864%E6%A0%BC.png.jpeg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/df/0duw9bvodjw42ggazlgzycrtowr4u53.png/160px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-3_%E6%AD%A3%E5%89%8D%E6%96%B9%E5%8D%8A%E5%9C%864%E6%A0%BC.png.jpeg 2x\" data-file-width=\"743\" data-file-height=\"743\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%98%BF%